{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06535","headline":"杂诗二首 一 · 储光羲","name":"杂诗二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"混沌本无象，末路多是非。\n达士志寥廓，所在能忘禨。\n耕凿时未至，还山聊采薇。\n虎豹对我蹲，鸑鷟旁我飞。\n仙人空中来，谓我勿复归。\n格泽爲君驾，虹蜺爲君衣。\n西游崑仑墟，可与世人违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06535.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06535","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}